WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
- Good day to just hop on cruise ship and

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.584
get acclimated.

00:00:04.584 --> 00:00:05.983
Looks like Nina's hungry again.

00:00:05.983 --> 00:00:07.029
(restaurant clattering)

00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:08.296
You got a full-on plate there.

00:00:08.296 --> 00:00:09.129
- I know.

00:00:09.129 --> 00:00:10.577
- What is that?

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:11.468
Holy.

00:00:11.468 --> 00:00:13.355
(rhythmic music)

00:00:13.355 --> 00:00:14.645
It's a video.

00:00:14.645 --> 00:00:16.360
- Oh, why you filming a video?

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.608
- You going to snore a lot?

00:00:17.608 --> 00:00:19.191
- No.
- Okay.

00:00:19.191 --> 00:00:22.608
(upbeat, rhythmic music)

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.944
What's up, Believe Nation?

00:00:34.944 --> 00:00:36.811
Happy Day Two!
(dinging)

00:00:36.811 --> 00:00:38.802
It's Day Two in London.

00:00:38.802 --> 00:00:41.011
We went to bed at 10 and woke up at four,

00:00:41.011 --> 00:00:42.643
so six hours, not that bad.

00:00:42.643 --> 00:00:44.882
Sun just came up here in London,

00:00:44.882 --> 00:00:48.457
and we are going to do a
little bit of London exploring

00:00:48.457 --> 00:00:51.240
and then head off to our cruise ship

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.005
to continue our journey.

00:00:54.005 --> 00:00:56.026
How you feeling?
- Not bad.

00:00:56.026 --> 00:00:58.005
- First we got to find Nina some coffee.

00:00:58.005 --> 00:00:59.184
- For you.

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:00.639
- For me?
- And you.

00:01:00.639 --> 00:01:02.614
Not just for me, okay?

00:01:02.614 --> 00:01:03.983
- I mean, I'll drink some, but--

00:01:03.983 --> 00:01:05.016
- Yeah, right.

00:01:05.016 --> 00:01:09.183
You the one who's all,
"Let's go get some coffee."

00:01:10.325 --> 00:01:11.158
- Nina's a--

00:01:11.158 --> 00:01:12.183
- Okay, let's go get some coffee now!

00:01:12.183 --> 00:01:14.424
- Nina gets grumpy until
she has her coffee, so we--

00:01:14.424 --> 00:01:15.257
- That's not true.

00:01:15.257 --> 00:01:16.151
- We're going to go find some.

00:01:16.151 --> 00:01:18.087
- That's not true. (Evan laughs)

00:01:18.087 --> 00:01:19.505
That's not true.
- Here we go!

00:01:19.505 --> 00:01:22.672
(upbeat guitar music)

00:01:30.591 --> 00:01:33.341
Sun rising over England, Big Ben

00:01:53.657 --> 00:01:55.608
We can't find Nina her Starbucks,

00:01:55.608 --> 00:01:57.860
so looks like it's Pret a Manger.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:01:59.228
- Oh they have baguettes.

00:01:59.228 --> 00:02:00.061
- [Evan] Yeah.

00:02:00.061 --> 00:02:00.894
- [Nina] Okay.

00:02:00.894 --> 00:02:02.563
- [Evan] Oh wow, see Nina's excited.

00:02:02.563 --> 00:02:05.063
Okay, in we go, Pret a Manger.

00:02:09.313 --> 00:02:11.461
There it is, our breakfast.

00:02:11.461 --> 00:02:15.501
Bagel, chocolate croissant,
and two coffees, mmm.

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:16.334
How's it feel?

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:18.751
You got your coffee.
- Good.

00:02:23.352 --> 00:02:24.757
- [ Evan] I'm still finishing my coffee,

00:02:24.757 --> 00:02:26.951
but Nina found something.

00:02:26.951 --> 00:02:28.309
What did you find, Nina?

00:02:28.309 --> 00:02:30.005
She's very excited.

00:02:30.005 --> 00:02:31.781
She found her Starbucks.

00:02:31.781 --> 00:02:33.801
What are you going to have?

00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:35.275
Caramel popcorn!

00:02:35.275 --> 00:02:36.135
What?

00:02:36.135 --> 00:02:38.085
I wasn't going to get anything, but

00:02:38.085 --> 00:02:39.790
I definitely need to try that one.

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:43.725
Starbucks here also has
salad bowls, interesting.

00:02:43.725 --> 00:02:45.258
How you feeling Nina?

00:02:45.258 --> 00:02:47.417
You found your Starbucks.
- Mm-hmm.

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:50.331
- [Evan] I still have to finish mine.

00:02:50.331 --> 00:02:51.555
I saw that smile though.
- Where is my share?

00:02:51.555 --> 00:02:53.200
- [Evan] We saw that smile.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.950
♫ Morning coffee

00:02:57.356 --> 00:03:00.023
♫ Drink it slow

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.129
- [Evan] Do I want you to taste if for me?

00:03:06.129 --> 00:03:07.137
- Yeah.

00:03:07.137 --> 00:03:10.550
- [Evan] Yeah, yes, I really
want you to taste it for me.

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.942
(Evan laughs)
Not like I have an option.

00:03:13.942 --> 00:03:14.775
How is it?

00:03:16.426 --> 00:03:18.762
Oh it's a lot of, look
at the whipped cream!

00:03:18.762 --> 00:03:19.595
- [ Nina] Yeah.

00:03:19.595 --> 00:03:20.910
- [Evan] Holy cow.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.514
Is that little pieces of popcorn on top?

00:03:22.514 --> 00:03:24.433
- [ Nina] Mm-hmm.

00:03:24.433 --> 00:03:25.884
- [Evan] 'Kay, let's give it a shot.

00:03:25.884 --> 00:03:26.717
Oh, it's good.

00:03:26.717 --> 00:03:27.614
It's lighter than I thought.

00:03:27.614 --> 00:03:30.040
They have these dual trays.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.898
I'm trying to figure out if
they actually make them dual,

00:03:31.898 --> 00:03:33.604
or they just ripped it in half.

00:03:33.604 --> 00:03:34.807
What do you think?

00:03:34.807 --> 00:03:35.640
- Ripped it in half.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:36.473
- [Evan] Ripped it in half?

00:03:36.473 --> 00:03:37.306
(PA announcing)

00:03:37.306 --> 00:03:38.428
I'm going to say they have it dual,

00:03:38.428 --> 00:03:40.959
because I want to discover something new.

00:03:40.959 --> 00:03:43.432
So it's, "Wow, look at this dual!

00:03:43.432 --> 00:03:45.011
"Wow, Nina!"

00:03:45.011 --> 00:03:46.653
We're here at the train station.

00:03:46.653 --> 00:03:50.147
Going to get our tickets
and head off to Southampton,

00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:53.177
and then we can head up onto our cruise.

00:03:53.177 --> 00:03:56.177
Book some dinners there, get set up.

00:03:57.328 --> 00:03:58.723
- [ Nina] 'Kay, buy tickets.

00:03:58.723 --> 00:03:59.556
- Buy tickets.

00:03:59.556 --> 00:04:04.394
Here we go.
(upbeat, rhythmic music)

00:04:04.394 --> 00:04:05.416
We're all settled in.

00:04:05.416 --> 00:04:08.121
Nina's takin' layers off.

00:04:08.121 --> 00:04:10.779
We got a nice table here.

00:04:10.779 --> 00:04:11.865
Maybe do some work.

00:04:11.865 --> 00:04:13.364
What are you going to do?
- I dunno.

00:04:13.364 --> 00:04:14.347
- [Evan] We going to chat?

00:04:14.347 --> 00:04:15.180
- Sure.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.013
- [Evan] You going to pass out?

00:04:16.013 --> 00:04:16.846
- No.

00:04:16.846 --> 00:04:20.263
- [Evan] Nina's probably
going to pass out.

00:04:45.058 --> 00:04:46.823
We arrived at Southampton.

00:04:46.823 --> 00:04:48.425
It's starting to rain.

00:04:48.425 --> 00:04:51.107
So, good day to just hop on a cruise ship

00:04:51.107 --> 00:04:52.690
and get acclimated.

00:04:53.599 --> 00:04:56.501
Grateful for the awesome day
we had yesterday with no rain.

00:04:56.501 --> 00:04:57.334
- [ Nina] Yeah.

00:04:57.334 --> 00:05:00.182
- So, we got to find the ship!

00:05:00.182 --> 00:05:01.714
Hopefully it doesn't rain too much.

00:05:01.714 --> 00:05:03.166
Get onboard!

00:05:03.166 --> 00:05:05.070
And come on guys, how cute
is Nina in her hoodie?

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.347
(Nina laughs)

00:05:06.347 --> 00:05:10.043
How cute is that little
creature in her hoodie, huh?

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:11.104
So cute!

00:05:11.104 --> 00:05:14.271
(playful piano music)

00:05:19.777 --> 00:05:20.972
We got our cards.

00:05:20.972 --> 00:05:23.759
Nina's orange cause she's new.

00:05:23.759 --> 00:05:25.024
And there's mine.

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:25.988
Oh, I lost my wife.

00:05:25.988 --> 00:05:28.008
Let's go find her.
(crowd chatting)

00:05:28.008 --> 00:05:28.953
There she is!

00:05:28.953 --> 00:05:30.764
We're gettin' on the boat
and Nina is hustling!

00:05:30.764 --> 00:05:32.750
I'm havin' a hard time
keepin' up with her.

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.167
Nina is a runner.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:38.740
The camera's shaking just
trying to catch up with you.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:42.096
What we need to do is book our specialty

00:05:42.096 --> 00:05:44.185
restaurant reservations,

00:05:44.185 --> 00:05:46.858
'cause it gets filled up super quick, so

00:05:46.858 --> 00:05:48.691
run right to the line.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.354
Alright restaurants are booked.

00:05:52.354 --> 00:05:54.873
Next step, we got to get some internet,

00:05:54.873 --> 00:05:56.498
get an internet package,

00:05:56.498 --> 00:06:01.003
so I can upload these videos
to Christina, my editor,

00:06:01.003 --> 00:06:02.988
and also review the videos

00:06:02.988 --> 00:06:05.101
coming out next week for you guys.

00:06:05.101 --> 00:06:06.831
Still got to do my work,

00:06:06.831 --> 00:06:10.164
make sure we're uploading
quality stuff, and then what?

00:06:10.164 --> 00:06:11.105
Then we're going to get some food, right?

00:06:11.105 --> 00:06:12.974
Ooh, internet package, look at this,

00:06:12.974 --> 00:06:14.367
there's nobody here though.

00:06:14.367 --> 00:06:15.703
How do we get internet?

00:06:15.703 --> 00:06:17.850
Where is the internet?

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.521
The manager's not here until two o'clock.

00:06:20.521 --> 00:06:22.911
So we're going to just get
some food while we wait.

00:06:22.911 --> 00:06:26.765
(upbeat, jazzy music)

00:06:26.765 --> 00:06:29.031
Alright, the feasting begins Nina.

00:06:29.031 --> 00:06:30.875
Look, see this menu?
(patrons chatting)

00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:32.315
- I think I'm feeling gross, I dunno.

00:06:32.315 --> 00:06:33.308
- Oh, man!

00:06:33.308 --> 00:06:35.483
You're feeling gross,
it's only the first day.

00:06:35.483 --> 00:06:38.233
Look at that, all these starters.

00:06:39.175 --> 00:06:40.008
Fruit,

00:06:41.671 --> 00:06:42.504
and then

00:06:43.993 --> 00:06:45.398
entrees,

00:06:45.398 --> 00:06:46.884
burgers,

00:06:46.884 --> 00:06:49.903
shrimp burger in a pretzel
bun with guacamole?

00:06:49.903 --> 00:06:51.338
Wah!

00:06:51.338 --> 00:06:52.171
This is exciting.

00:06:52.171 --> 00:06:53.418
And dessert.

00:06:53.418 --> 00:06:55.055
We get dessert at lunch time Nina.

00:06:55.055 --> 00:06:56.086
What do you think?

00:06:56.086 --> 00:06:58.586
That doesn't exist in Toronto.

00:07:01.758 --> 00:07:03.146
Hey Nina.
- Hi.

00:07:03.146 --> 00:07:05.088
- [Evan] How do you feel after
your first meal on the boat?

00:07:05.088 --> 00:07:06.088
- It's good.

00:07:06.946 --> 00:07:09.314
- Nina had two glasses of wine.

00:07:09.314 --> 00:07:10.147
Where are we going?

00:07:10.147 --> 00:07:10.980
Ninety what?

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:11.845
- [ Nina] Ninety six oh eight.

00:07:11.845 --> 00:07:13.958
- Ninety six, on this side.

00:07:13.958 --> 00:07:15.875
I'm feeling super full.

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:19.357
Are you not full?

00:07:19.357 --> 00:07:21.760
Oh, you didn't finish your food though.

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:22.593
- [ Nina] Yeah.

00:07:22.593 --> 00:07:24.024
- This way, let's go see if it's ready.

00:07:24.024 --> 00:07:24.860
See if our room is ready.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:27.124
We're sneakin' in early.

00:07:27.124 --> 00:07:29.573
Alright, here's our room.

00:07:29.573 --> 00:07:30.641
Here is our room!

00:07:30.641 --> 00:07:33.544
Welcome to 9-6-0-8.

00:07:33.544 --> 00:07:35.761
Our home for the next--
- Ten days.

00:07:35.761 --> 00:07:37.261
- [Evan] Ten days?

00:07:39.539 --> 00:07:40.372
- Kind of scared. (laughs)

00:07:40.372 --> 00:07:41.540
Why is this on?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:42.492
- [Evan] Why are you scared?

00:07:42.492 --> 00:07:44.361
- Because the TV is on.

00:07:44.361 --> 00:07:45.480
- [Evan] Oh the TV's on.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.313
- [ Nina] Yes.

00:07:46.313 --> 00:07:47.525
- [Evan] There ya go.

00:07:47.525 --> 00:07:49.092
- [ Nina] Oh we have a champagne too!

00:07:49.092 --> 00:07:50.787
- [Evan] We got some champagne.

00:07:50.787 --> 00:07:52.854
There's the balcony.

00:07:52.854 --> 00:07:53.687
Look at that!

00:07:53.687 --> 00:07:56.186
We got a little couch
here for Nina to sleep on.

00:07:56.186 --> 00:07:57.659
- No. (Evan laughs)

00:07:57.659 --> 00:07:59.826
Maybe for you to sleep on!

00:08:00.968 --> 00:08:02.434
- [Evan] At the balcony.

00:08:02.434 --> 00:08:05.394
Yeah, alright, happy times!

00:08:05.394 --> 00:08:06.485
I don't know why this is on.

00:08:06.485 --> 00:08:07.902
- [TV] This drill is how
to familiarize you with--

00:08:07.902 --> 00:08:08.832
- [Evan] Oh, the drill.

00:08:08.832 --> 00:08:09.832
I don't do the drill.

00:08:09.832 --> 00:08:11.720
Nina and I skip the drill.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.637
- [ Nina] Every time.

00:08:12.637 --> 00:08:14.994
- [Evan] But, really
we need to have CNN on.

00:08:14.994 --> 00:08:16.318
Where's CNN?

00:08:16.318 --> 00:08:18.466
How is there no CNN?

00:08:18.466 --> 00:08:19.836
No information.

00:08:19.836 --> 00:08:21.415
Daily.

00:08:21.415 --> 00:08:22.993
Bridge, Safety, BowCam,

00:08:22.993 --> 00:08:25.513
Jade TV, ShoreEX, Onboard,

00:08:25.513 --> 00:08:27.547
Sky, CNBC, BBC,

00:08:27.547 --> 00:08:29.297
Sky News, TV5, Prime.

00:08:30.159 --> 00:08:31.409
There's no CNN!

00:08:32.551 --> 00:08:33.967
What are we going to watch?

00:08:33.967 --> 00:08:34.967
CNBC, maybe.

00:08:35.836 --> 00:08:36.669
Wow!

00:08:37.964 --> 00:08:39.176
Alright, there we go.

00:08:39.176 --> 00:08:40.009
- [ Nina] You know what?

00:08:40.009 --> 00:08:40.842
- [Evan] There we go.

00:08:40.842 --> 00:08:41.809
- [ Nina] Evan?

00:08:41.809 --> 00:08:43.278
- [Evan] What, Nina?

00:08:43.278 --> 00:08:44.427
- Alcohol.

00:08:44.427 --> 00:08:45.260
- [Evan] Yes.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:46.131
- Alcohol.

00:08:46.131 --> 00:08:46.964
- [Evan] Okay.

00:08:46.964 --> 00:08:48.484
What, you're such an alcoholic!

00:08:48.484 --> 00:08:49.749
- Sparkling wine.

00:08:49.749 --> 00:08:52.117
- Okay, you already
had two glasses of wine

00:08:52.117 --> 00:08:54.826
and it's not even noon yet, okay?

00:08:54.826 --> 00:08:57.262
Nina wants me to film the
bathroom to show you guys.

00:08:57.262 --> 00:08:58.095
- I want to show you.

00:08:58.095 --> 00:08:58.928
- [Evan] Here we go.

00:08:58.928 --> 00:08:59.810
Okay, Here's Nina.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:00.643
- Shower room.

00:09:00.643 --> 00:09:01.733
- [Evan] Shower room.

00:09:01.733 --> 00:09:03.216
- [ Nina] They have
different door. (door slides)

00:09:03.216 --> 00:09:05.002
- [Evan] Uh huh.

00:09:05.002 --> 00:09:05.835
- Bathroom!

00:09:05.835 --> 00:09:06.668
- [Evan] You're very excited.

00:09:06.668 --> 00:09:07.501
- [ Nina] Mirror, bathroom.

00:09:07.501 --> 00:09:08.334
- [Evan] Toilet--

00:09:08.334 --> 00:09:09.862
- Toilet, this is a different door.

00:09:09.862 --> 00:09:11.149
You're very excited about this.

00:09:11.149 --> 00:09:14.202
- So you could shower and
I could use the bathroom.

00:09:14.202 --> 00:09:16.490
(rhythmic, melodic music)

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.185
- [Evan] We got our internet for the week,

00:09:18.185 --> 00:09:21.047
but Nina's missing Timo.
- Yeah.

00:09:21.047 --> 00:09:22.323
- [Evan] It's only been a day,

00:09:22.323 --> 00:09:23.156
maybe two.

00:09:24.879 --> 00:09:25.712
What's he doing?

00:09:25.712 --> 00:09:27.225
Do you think he misses you?
- Yeah.

00:09:27.225 --> 00:09:28.058
- [Evan] You think so?

00:09:28.058 --> 00:09:30.140
- Uh huh.
- Okay.

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:34.253
I think so too, a lot, I
think he really misses you.

00:09:34.253 --> 00:09:36.201
We're checking out the buffet.
(patrons chatting)

00:09:36.201 --> 00:09:40.045
Just to see if there's any
other options that we missed.

00:09:40.045 --> 00:09:42.628
We might get a little peckish.

00:09:54.569 --> 00:09:56.960
Looks like Nina's hungry again.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.203
You got a full-on plate there.

00:09:58.203 --> 00:09:59.036
- I know.

00:09:59.036 --> 00:10:00.385
- [Evan] What is that?

00:10:00.385 --> 00:10:01.593
Holy. (swooshing)

00:10:01.593 --> 00:10:02.426
So--

00:10:03.282 --> 00:10:04.234
- [ Nina] Had a nap.

00:10:04.234 --> 00:10:05.732
- You napped too.
- Yeah.

00:10:05.732 --> 00:10:06.974
- We both passed out.

00:10:06.974 --> 00:10:08.924
Woke up, boat was moving,

00:10:08.924 --> 00:10:10.910
and now we're going to dinner. (laughs)

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:13.348
We ate, slept, and have go eat again.

00:10:13.348 --> 00:10:16.239
Nina's wearin' a new dress.
- They can't see.

00:10:16.239 --> 00:10:17.884
- [Evan] Oh, you got a sweater over it.

00:10:17.884 --> 00:10:18.717
- I got a sweater over it.

00:10:18.717 --> 00:10:19.550
- [Evan] There you go.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.383
- [ Nina] OK.

00:10:20.383 --> 00:10:21.216
- This is actually--

00:10:21.216 --> 00:10:22.725
- I'm showing the tummy.
- You're showing your tummy.

00:10:22.725 --> 00:10:24.970
Well, there's a lot of
food in that tummy, and--

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:25.803
- [ Nina] Yeah. (chuckles)

00:10:25.803 --> 00:10:27.391
- There's about to get a
lot more food, in there.

00:10:27.391 --> 00:10:28.479
- [ Nina] Yeah.

00:10:28.479 --> 00:10:29.349
- Okay?

00:10:29.349 --> 00:10:30.378
Let's go eat.

00:10:30.378 --> 00:10:33.545
(light, bouncy music)

00:10:36.934 --> 00:10:38.049
Nina wants to throw up.
(patrons chatting)

00:10:38.049 --> 00:10:41.752
She's feeling very full after
her huge steak and potatoes.

00:10:41.752 --> 00:10:45.839
But she still wants to
see the dessert menu.

00:10:45.839 --> 00:10:46.672
Yeah?

00:10:48.173 --> 00:10:49.322
- No, I probably won't have anything.

00:10:49.322 --> 00:10:51.017
I want to go see the desserts.

00:10:51.017 --> 00:10:53.934
- [Evan] Uh-huh, alright we'll see.

00:10:56.079 --> 00:10:58.390
Finished the dinner, (gasps) feeling full.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:10:59.388
How you doin'?

00:10:59.388 --> 00:11:00.595
- Very full.
- Very full.

00:11:00.595 --> 00:11:03.405
Nina grabbed another
champagne on the way out.

00:11:03.405 --> 00:11:05.634
And we're going to go
head up to the 12th floor

00:11:05.634 --> 00:11:09.801
to see what the buffet
has to offer! (both laugh)

00:11:11.311 --> 00:11:15.282
As soon as we got out,
Nina's like, go upstairs?

00:11:15.282 --> 00:11:16.896
(Nina laughs)

00:11:16.896 --> 00:11:18.928
Which means go to the
buffet. (walking on stairs)

00:11:18.928 --> 00:11:20.750
So we'll see what else Nina orders.

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:23.862
- No, I said I need some warm water.

00:11:23.862 --> 00:11:27.229
- Uh huh, let's see if
Nina only has warm water.

00:11:27.229 --> 00:11:29.574
Here comes the reality check.

00:11:29.574 --> 00:11:31.491
Let's see what happens.

00:11:33.736 --> 00:11:36.043
What are we doing, Nina?
- Shows.

00:11:36.043 --> 00:11:37.178
- Watch the show.

00:11:37.178 --> 00:11:38.049
It's showtime.

00:11:38.049 --> 00:11:41.132
(light guitar music)

00:11:42.391 --> 00:11:43.628
It's a video.

00:11:43.628 --> 00:11:45.031
- Oh, why are you filming a video?

00:11:45.031 --> 00:11:45.864
- 'Cause it get--
- Holy Cow,

00:11:45.864 --> 00:11:47.373
I thought it was a picture.
- Look how cute you look.

00:11:47.373 --> 00:11:49.323
Doesn't Nina look cute?

00:11:49.323 --> 00:11:50.356
Leave Nina a comment

00:11:50.356 --> 00:11:52.677
if you think she looks cute in the thumbs.

00:11:52.677 --> 00:11:53.643
In the thumbs?
- In the thumbs.

00:11:53.643 --> 00:11:55.143
- In the comments.

00:11:56.883 --> 00:11:59.198
We weren't allowed to
film, copyright stuff.

00:11:59.198 --> 00:12:00.260
(loud rock music)

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:03.000
But Nina was freaking out the whole time.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.032
- Yeah, it was just too good.

00:12:05.032 --> 00:12:06.437
- Screaming, and--
- Yeah, yeah.

00:12:06.437 --> 00:12:08.062
I never freak out at any show,

00:12:08.062 --> 00:12:10.175
but this one is the best.

00:12:10.175 --> 00:12:14.160
Have to say. (crowd laughing)

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:17.327
(lively guitar music)

00:12:23.859 --> 00:12:26.019
- [Evan] Nina got us some more food.

00:12:26.019 --> 00:12:27.296
- [ Nina] For Evan.

00:12:27.296 --> 00:12:28.701
- [Evan] That's not all for me.

00:12:28.701 --> 00:12:31.198
- [ Nina] And we'll have
the wings and spring roll.

00:12:31.198 --> 00:12:32.440
The cookies are for you.

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:34.964
- [Evan] Nina got some more alcohol too.

00:12:34.964 --> 00:12:35.797
- [ Nina] I was going to get more

00:12:35.797 --> 00:12:36.880
but they closed the downstairs--

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:37.713
- I was going to get more?

00:12:37.713 --> 00:12:38.546
How many drinks do you need?

00:12:38.546 --> 00:12:39.446
We're going to bed!

00:12:39.446 --> 00:12:40.526
It's eleven o'clock.

00:12:40.526 --> 00:12:42.012
You don't need more drinks.

00:12:42.012 --> 00:12:44.624
Well thank you guys for
joining us for day two.

00:12:44.624 --> 00:12:47.016
Tomorrow we are off to Holland,

00:12:47.016 --> 00:12:48.676
to have another fun day.

00:12:48.676 --> 00:12:49.802
- Meet up with a friend.

00:12:49.802 --> 00:12:52.809
- We'll see if Nina gets out
of bed in the morning. (laughs)

00:12:52.809 --> 00:12:53.761
- Of course I will get out of bed.

00:12:53.761 --> 00:12:55.043
- From all the alcohol.
- You're shitty,

00:12:55.043 --> 00:12:57.786
I don't sleep much when I have alcohol.

00:12:57.786 --> 00:12:59.365
- Alright, thank you guys for watching!

00:12:59.365 --> 00:13:01.595
Have an amazing weekend!

00:13:01.595 --> 00:13:03.127
We believe in you.

00:13:03.127 --> 00:13:05.205
- Continue to believe,

00:13:05.205 --> 00:13:07.829
'cause it's important.

00:13:07.829 --> 00:13:09.305
Much love,

00:13:09.305 --> 00:13:11.444
and whatever your one word is,

00:13:11.444 --> 00:13:13.105
we'll see you soon!

00:13:13.105 --> 00:13:15.473
Wait, we'll see, 'kay, stop.

00:13:15.473 --> 00:13:17.249
We'll see you soon. (Evan laughs)

00:13:17.249 --> 00:13:19.050
Bye. (tosses a kiss)

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:21.479
(deep swooshing)
(banging)

